Z||000004||Haze_Performance||10-08-2001||10:44 PM||||Will the car be on concrete? Heres what I'm doing:<P>* Full tank of gas with gas treatment.<P>* Clean & Armor all the interior.<BR> <BR>* A good coat of 100% Carnuba Wax on the body.<P>* Putting the car up on 4 jackstands.<P>* Putting 4 wheel tarps on. (You can buy them at a RV type store. They are the same martial as car covers).<P>* Quality car cover (remove antenna before installing).<P>* Large plastic/fiber style construction tarp.<P>* Bungee all the stuff down.<P><BR>---------------------------------------------<P><BR>  <P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/smallindysig_copy.jpg">              .              <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/smallredsig.jpg">        <BR><FONT SIZE="1"><FONT COLOR="red">Classic Fiero Owners - <A HREF="http://www.WS6Fiero.com" TARGET=_blank>Click Here</A> - Pennocks Wild Rides - <A HREF="http://clubs.yahoo.com/clubs/ws6fiero" TARGET=_blank>Click Here</A> </FONT></FONT>||||reg||10
Z||000005||88CoupeV6||10-09-2001||11:18 AM||||Also <BR>-fresh oil,<BR>-check coolant,<BR>-lube all hinges with some white lithium,<BR>-I also spray some WD-40 on all metal areas under and on the car to give some moisture protection.<P>------------------<BR>Josh<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/newsig.jpg">    <BR>:D  <BR><A HREF="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/AlbumList?u=1249362" TARGET=_blank>My pics</A>||||reg||3
